  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Innate Technique</em></p><blockquote><p>Love Rendezvous is a technique based on the Southern Cross. It marks creatures or objects with cursed energy and makes the lowest star have to pass through the other ones before they can move.</p></blockquote><p>Your innate technique grants you the following features as you gain levels in a class with the Innate Technique feature:</p><ul><li><strong>1st level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.HlC6hqoZAtbyQ2hV]{Love Rendezvous}</li><li><strong>3rd level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.WabghuPJeXcFn395]{Effective Marking}</li><li><strong>6th level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.6YKKWuvr7DmwRzmS]{Gravity}</li><li><strong>11th level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.jRT6oAmJpbn9zSBI]{Shining Stars}</li><li><strong>18th level:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.jjk5e.jjk5e-techniques.Item.Z9I5KdkmVysGWEBn]{Domain Expansion: Star Crossed Lovers}</li></ul>",
